ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610850/extras/b4b12e4a8adc376441f9121e7ba49906.webm?t=1699410249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610850/extras/b4b12e4a8adc376441f9121e7ba49906.mp4?t=1699410249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The game takes place directly after the events of the first game, in <i>Red Trigger</i>. Uncover the dark truth of this universe through the events of the game, but also through <i>Bioshock</i>-esque audio logs. Piece all those elements together to discover the secrets of this abstract world inside a digital server. All the characters are fully voice-acted and are full of personality. <br><br><i>Red Trigger 2</i> is about 10 times bigger than <i>Red Trigger</i>.<br><br>To keep updated on all our news, follow us on social media on Facebook or Twitter! And most of all, make sure to wishlist the game!",
